C('''loyo=pd.read_csv('results/leave_one_year_out.csv');display(loyo.round(3));fig,ax=plt.subplots(figsize=(9,3.2));ax.bar(loyo.excluded_year.astype(str),loyo.improvement);ax.axhline(0,color='gray');ax.tick_params(axis='x',rotation=90);ax.set_title('Leave-one-calendar-year-out (not company-out)');plt.show()''')
S(12,'Bias Audit & Verdict','''**Lookahead:** two-month lag and target-availability purge are explicit, but 2026-revised G.17 values are not vintage-safe. **Selection:** this hypothesis was selected after many industry studies; uncorrected familywise discovery risk is high. **Survivorship:** no security universe was constructed; company exposure illustrations reflect FY2025 only. **Multiple testing:** 16 horizon/lag scenarios and exploratory perturbations are diagnostic, not a searched trading strategy. **Nonstationarity:** 2020 shutdown, 2021 chip supply constraints, strikes, EV transition and revisions change the mapping. **Costs:** trading costs, spreads, taxes, capacity and benchmark-adjusted returns are NOT TESTED. **Verdict:** computed below; without company fundamentals and adjusted total returns, this is strictly a macro-production forecasting pilot.''')
